{%- if rb_part == 'glance' -%}
<p class="lead pdp__glance">Your private, evening sanctuary in a bar. Woody combines the rich, creamy warmth of ancient Sandalwood with the smoky, sweet undertones of fine Tobacco leaf. Designed to capture the cozy essence of a leather-bound study, this deeply grounding bar helps you decompress after a long day while delivering intensive, skin-conditioning moisture.</p>
{%- else -%}
<div class="acc open">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="true">Description<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte">
    <h3>The Science and Targeted Therapeutic Benefits</h3>
    <p>Woody is a deeply comforting, intensely hydrating remedy built for hard-working, weather-beaten skin. It carries a heavy, smoky aroma reminiscent of a vintage, leather-bound private library. By combining grounding sandalwood with robust tobacco leaf extracts, this emollient block shields your skin from drying out due to cold winds, sweat, or manual labor.</p>
    <h3>Key Skin Benefits</h3>
    <ul>
                    <li>Sandalwood Oil (Santalum Album): Celebrated for centuries as a therapeutic skin healer. It delivers intensive anti-inflammatory relief to raw, chapped, or wind-burned skin tissue while locking in deep hydration</li>
                    <li>Tobacco Leaf Extract (Nicotiana Tabacum): Packed with skinconditioning bioflavonoids, it serves as a natural soothing agent that calms superficial itchiness and binds moisture to the epidermal layer</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>The Profile:</strong> Rich, smoky, and ultra-grounding</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">Ingredients<span class="plus">+</span></button>
  <div class="acc__body rte"><p>Goat's Milk, Cedarwood Oil, Sandalwood Oil, Tobacco Oil, Organic Patchouli Oil, Sweet Orange Oil, Organic Bergamot Oil, Natural Coloring, and Natural Preservative.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="acc">
  <button type="button" aria-expanded="false">The Ritual<span class="plus">+</span></button>
